---
// Verbatim Authentic Copy, Exact Nomenclature & Official Policy
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Cancellation Policy"
  description="Khao Sok Riverside Cottages cancellation policy: No advance deposits required, operating on the honor system. Contact us promptly for changes or cancellations."
  heroImage="/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/Khao-Sok-Riverside-Cottages-Room.jpg"
  heroTitle="Cancellation Policy"
  heroSubtitle="Fair, Flexible & Honor-System Hospitality"
  breadcrumbs={[{"label": "Cancellation Policy", "href": "/cancellation-policy/"}]}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-10">
    <div class="bg-[#faf8f5]/95 border border-[#12281b]/10 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:p-8 md:p-12 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
      
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#12281b]/10 pb-4 mb-8 font-sans text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] font-medium uppercase text-[#163824]">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold">
          <span class="text-[#7a5813]">KSR</span>
          <span class="text-[#12281b]/20">/</span>
          <span>FIELD DISPATCH</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[#7a5813] font-bold">KHAO SOK · THAILAND</span>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-[#223e2c] text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed font-normal">

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight mt-2 mb-4"><span>What is your Cancellation Policy?</span>
        </h2>

        <!-- Verbatim Authentic Policy Statement -->
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#ba9038]/30 shadow-md space-y-4">
          <p class="leading-relaxed text-[#12281b] text-lg sm:text-xl font-display">
            The policy is very simple – <strong class="text-[#163824] font-bold">we do not take any deposits</strong> and rely on the <strong class="text-[#ba9038] font-bold">honor system</strong>.
          </p>
          <p class="leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
            This means it is <strong class="text-[#12281b]">extremely important</strong> that you <strong class="text-[#163824]">let us know ASAP</strong> if you need to <strong class="text-[#163824]">change or cancel your reservation</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Contact Channels for Changes / Cancellations -->
        <div class="pt-6 border-t border-[#12281b]/10 space-y-4">
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl text-[#163824] font-semibold tracking-tight">
            How to Cancel or Change a Reservation
          </h3>
          <p class="leading-relaxed text-[#223e2c]">
            To cancel or change a reservation, please contact our friendly English-speaking team directly:
          </p>

          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
            <a
              href="mailto:khaosokriver@gmail.com"
              class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#12281b]/10 hover:border-[#ba9038] shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all group flex items-start gap-4"
            >
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#2e6b45]/10 text-[#2e6b45] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-[#ba9038] group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
                ✉️
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[#2e6b45] font-semibold">Email Reservations</p>
                <p class="text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold text-[#12281b] group-hover:text-[#ba9038] transition-colors mt-0.5">khaosokriver@gmail.com</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-[#264634] font-medium mt-1">Prompt response within a few hours</p>
              </div>
            </a>

            <a
              href="tel:+6677395159"
              class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-[#12281b]/10 hover:border-[#ba9038] shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-all group flex items-start gap-4"
            >
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#2e6b45]/10 text-[#2e6b45] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:bg-[#ba9038] group-hover:text-white transition-colors">
                📞
              </div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[#2e6b45] font-semibold">Telephone Desk</p>
                <p class="text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold text-[#12281b] group-hover:text-[#ba9038] transition-colors mt-0.5">(+66) 77 395- 159</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-[#264634] font-medium mt-1">Front desk daily: 07:30 – 20:30</p>
              </div>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Honor System Notice -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#f4efeb] border border-[#12281b]/10 space-y-2 mt-6">
          <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#255038] font-bold">Why the Honor System Matters</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#223e2c] leading-relaxed">
            As an independent family-run eco-resort with a limited number of riverside cottages and floating raft houses, holding a room prevents others from experiencing Khao Sok. By notifying us as soon as your plans shift, we can make your spot available to other travelers. We thank you warmly for your consideration!
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-8 border-t border-[#12281b]/10">
        <a href="/booking-khao-sok-accommodation/" class="px-6 py-3.5 bg-[#ba9038] hover:bg-[#d8b257] text-[#12281b] font-semibold rounded-xl text-sm transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg shadow-[#ba9038]/20">
          Book Your Stay & Tours
        </a>
        <a href="/contact-khao-sok-riverside-cottages/" class="px-6 py-3.5 border border-[#12281b]/20 hover:border-[#2e6b45] text-[#12281b] hover:text-[#2e6b45] rounded-xl text-sm transition-all duration-200 font-medium">
          Contact Concierge
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </article>
</PageLayout>
